THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

ScanPro uses third-party components and services for code processing,
advertising, consent and purchases:

  • ZXing — code encoding, under its applicable open-source license.
  • Google ML Kit — barcode decoding, subject to Google's terms.
  • AndroidSVG — SVG rendering, under its applicable open-source license.
  • RevenueCat — subscription and purchase management.
  • Google Play Billing — payment processing, subject to Google's terms.
  • Google AdMob and UMP — advertising and applicable privacy choices.
    Ads remain enabled for Premium users; Supporter products remove ads.

Third-party components retain their respective licenses and terms.

All other components of the Software remain subject to this proprietary
license.

